# Storyboard: three silent site loops

All three: square dots on #0e0c0b, off-white #f2ece1 for people and things, amber #e9b15d only for what is "live".
No words on screen. Each loop's last frame matches its first, so it plays forever without a seam.
The camera is a slow, constant drift (never easing to a stop), so the loop point joins motion to motion.

## hero.mp4 — 1920 × 1008, 12 s loop. Poster: frame 120 (mid-pour).

Changed on the person's note: "sushi on a table with a cocktail getting poured" replaces the orrery.

| scene | on screen | narration | payoff |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 (0–1 s) | Medium shot along a bar counter at night, bottles dim on the back shelf. On the left, a wooden board of sushi: nigiri and maki. On the right, an empty coupe. A shaker tips in from the top right. | none | A table set for someone. |
| 2 (1–7 s) | The pour: an amber stream falls into the coupe and the drink rises. The amber is the only warm light. | none | Made for you, right now. |
| 3 (7–9.5 s) | The stream thins and stops; the shaker lifts away. The full glass sits beside the sushi. | none | Served. |
| 4 (9.5–12 s) | The full glass slides off to the right, served, and a fresh empty coupe slides in to the same spot, ready for the next pour. The camera drifts throughout. | none | The next guest's turn. |

## agents.mp4 — 1440 × 1080, 10 s loop. Poster: frame 150 (the moment they agree).

| scene | on screen | narration | payoff |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 (0–3 s) | A field of faint grey dots: a city at night. Four brighter dots (four friends' agents) pulse gently, far apart. | none | Each person has their own agent. |
| 2 (3–5 s) | Thin off-white lines reach out from each agent to the others; short dot "messages" travel along them. | none | They talk to each other directly. |
| 3 (5–7 s) | The lines tighten on one point between them; that point lights amber (the dinner spot). | none | They agree on one place. |
| 4 (7–10 s) | The amber spot holds and glows; the lines fade back to the faint field, ready to start again. | none | Done, with no group chat. |

## stools.mp4 — 2400 × 600, 14 s loop. Poster: frame 300 (all five seats taken, queue formed).

| scene | on screen | narration | payoff |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 (0–6 s) | A bar counter in dots, side-on, with five stools. One by one, a dot figure walks in from the left and sits; each seat's small lamp warms to amber as it's taken. | none | The room opens in steps. |
| 2 (6–10 s) | All five seats are full. New figures arrive and stand in a short, calm queue at the right; their lamps stay grey. | none | At the cap, people wait; nobody is squeezed in. |
| 3 (10–14 s) | One seated figure stands and leaves left; the first in the queue takes the seat (its lamp warms); the rest step up, back to the opening state. | none | A seat frees up only when someone leaves. |
